  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IRELANDS HORN OF AFRICA CHILD WASTING INITIATIVE 2023-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The grant will support Concern to implement the Preventing Wasting in the Mandera Triangle (PWiMT) Programme, a multi-country (Ethiopia, Kenya, and Somalia), multi-sectoral, cross border programme to address child wasting in the Horn of Africa working closely with HoA Embassies and HQ food and humanitarian experts within the context of the HoA Child Wasting Initiative and Ireland&#x2019;s overall pledge to advance the UN Global Action Plan (GAP) on Child Wasting. The PWiMT will prevent child wasting in the most vulnerable communities and households via three main pathways: 1) improving feeding and caring behaviours; 2) improving food security and climate resilient livelihood strategies; and 3) influencing relevant country and regional strategies to prevent wasting.</narrative>
  </description>
